(text "TS06-DRV  ·  Power in"
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 12.7 0)
(effects
(font
(size 3 3)
(bold yes)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "3f92c7eb-c500-5b28-965d-cd216eaa84e3")
)
(text "12 V arrives on a 5.5 x 2.1 mm barrel jack, centre positive; its switch contact is grounded. A 1.1 A\nresettable fuse and a 3 A Schottky (1N5822) guard against overload and reverse polarity. A 100 uF bulk\ncapacitor feeds the boost converter's 1.3 A pulses at 31 kHz."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 19.05 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.524 1.524)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "78086026-d44a-51ce-8295-e9690945a14b")
)
(text "Notes from tools/ts06pair.py"
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 63.5 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.524 1.524)
(bold yes)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "df146f81-d51d-5e49-84a5-b57da8d4797f")
)
(text "C8: 12 V bulk: the boost draws 1.3 A pulses at 31 kHz.\nF1: Resettable fuse.\nVD2: Reverse-polarity protection, 3 A Schottky: 1 cathode, 2 anode.\nXS1: 12 V barrel jack, centre positive. Pin 3 is the switch contact, grounded."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 66.04 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.27 1.27)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "f5359d51-69a6-588e-94bd-2e7110964cf1")
)
